"Elva Wyrmscar died falling from a Direwing, and an Earth girl named Jessica woke in her body."
"Jessica died at sixteen on Earth when a meteor struck her, and she keeps Elva's memories only dimly."
"The tribe explains Elva's gaps by a blow to the head in her fall."
"The mask maker senses that the face and the self behind Elva's mask no longer align."
"Iris, Elva's bonded Hell Hound, speaks into Elva's mind and hides her speech from the tribe."
"Iris secretly directs Elva and weighs ruling the tribe through her."
"Elva and Iris share a sworn pact to kill Valrok for slaying Iris's father."
"Valrok claims he killed Iris's two remaining sisters, but both are alive."
"The Nameless Hell Hound wiped out Valrok's twenty-man hunting party."
"Valrok knows a Hell Hound that thinks and writes escaped him, and hunts it for the thrill."
